    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Note \u2013 Currently, only a VR version is planned!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Goblin God</strong> \u2013 Rule, Protect, and Cause Chaos!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations! You\u2019ve ascended to divinity\u2014not as a mighty celestial being, but as the god of goblins. These little green weirdos worship you, build wonders in your name, and sometimes set themselves on fire by accident. Your job? Keep them alive or unalive while defending them from relentless waves of evil humans who <i>really</i> don\u2019t like goblin deities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0 <strong>God Mode Activated</strong> \u2013 Smite enemies, bless your goblins, or just throw things around for fun. You're the god here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0 <strong>Build a Goblin Empire</strong> \u2013 Guide your followers as they construct villages and build a magnificent wonder in your honor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Defend Against Evil Humans</strong> \u2013 Humans aren\u2019t happy about your goblin cult. Too bad for them. Command your goblins in battle or personally intervene in divine (and chaotic) ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdd <strong>Explore Unique Islands</strong> \u2013 Each level is a new island with different challenges, resources, and environmental quirks. Adapt and thrive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Chill or Cause Havoc</strong> \u2013 Prefer a peaceful experience? You can just build a cozy goblin village and enjoy watching your worshippers go about their lives.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Note \u2013 Currently, only a VR version is planned!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Goblin God</strong> \u2013 Rule, Protect, and Cause Chaos!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations! You\u2019ve ascended to divinity\u2014not as a mighty celestial being, but as the god of goblins. These little green weirdos worship you, build wonders in your name, and sometimes set themselves on fire by accident. Your job? Keep them alive or unalive while defending them from relentless waves of evil humans who <i>really</i> don\u2019t like goblin deities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0 <strong>God Mode Activated</strong> \u2013 Smite enemies, bless your goblins, or just throw things around for fun. You're the god here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0 <strong>Build a Goblin Empire</strong> \u2013 Guide your followers as they construct villages and build a magnificent wonder in your honor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Defend Against Evil Humans</strong> \u2013 Humans aren\u2019t happy about your goblin cult. Too bad for them. Command your goblins in battle or personally intervene in divine (and chaotic) ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdd <strong>Explore Unique Islands</strong> \u2013 Each level is a new island with different challenges, resources, and environmental quirks. Adapt and thrive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Chill or Cause Havoc</strong> \u2013 Prefer a peaceful experience? You can just build a cozy goblin village and enjoy watching your worshippers go about their lives.</p>",
    "short_description": "In Goblin God, you rule a tribe of chaotic goblins! Build villages, defend against evil humans, and unleash divine powers to shape the world (or cause mayhem). Each island brings new challenges\u2014will you lead your goblins to glory or just enjoy the chaos?",
